---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import ApproachShowcase from "../components/ApproachShowcase.astro";

---
<SiteLayout title="Our Approach to Lead Generation" description="How LeadsFlo connects advertising, creative, conversion, automation and appointment setting in one lead generation process." path="/our-approach/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">OUR APPROACH</p><h1>One connected journey. From attention to appointment.</h1><p class="lf-lede">A campaign is only as useful as the journey that follows it. We start with your commercial goal, then connect the pieces needed to generate and convert qualified demand.</p><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Talk through your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>OUR PRINCIPLE</span><strong>Every stage should make the next one easier.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<ApproachShowcase />

<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE SYSTEM</p><h2>Five connected disciplines.</h2></div><div class="lf-approach-stack"><a href="/performance-marketing/"><span>01 / ATTRACT</span><strong>Performance marketing</strong><em>Find the right audience ↗</em></a><a href="/ad-creatives-content/"><span>02 / ENGAGE</span><strong>Creative & content</strong><em>Communicate the offer ↗</em></a><a href="/websites-funnels/"><span>03 / CAPTURE</span><strong>Websites & funnels</strong><em>Make it easy to inquire ↗</em></a><a href="/crm-automation/"><span>04 / NURTURE</span><strong>CRM & automation</strong><em>Keep leads moving ↗</em></a><a href="/appointment-setting/"><span>05 / BOOK</span><strong>Appointment setting</strong><em>Turn interest into a conversation ↗</em></a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">MEASUREMENT</p><h2>Look beyond cost per lead.</h2><p>Reporting becomes more useful when it includes what happens after someone fills out a form.</p></div><div class="lf-prose"><h3>What we want to understand</h3><p>Lead volume matters, but so do fit, speed to response, booked appointments and meaningful sales outcomes. The metrics we can report depend on your tracking, CRM data and sales process.</p><h3>How we decide what to improve</h3><p>If campaigns produce clicks but few leads, we investigate the offer and landing experience. If leads arrive but appointments do not, we look at qualification, response time and follow-up. Improvements should address the real bottleneck, not the loudest dashboard number.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">GROW WITH CLARITY</p><h2>Build a system around the outcome you need.</h2></div><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Let's talk <span>↗</span></a></div></section>

</SiteLayout>